<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<link rel="icon" href="../favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<meta name="description" content="About ASPS — Наша миссия, values, and commitment to protecting people from scams through ethical AI and human-centered design."/>
<title>О нас — ASPS</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,16..72,400;0,16..72,500;0,16..72,600;0,16..72,700;1,16..72,400;1,16..72,500;1,16..72,600&family=Syne:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root{
  --bg-dark:#070B14; --bg-paper:#FAF7F2; --bg-paper-2:#F3EFE8;
  --accent:#BE3A4B; --accent-strong:#8E1A2A;
  --ink:#1A1814; --ink-2:#4A4640; --ink-3:#6B655C;
  --rule:#E4DDD2; --rule-2:#D7CFC2;
  --font-body:'Instrument Sans',-apple-system,sans-serif;
  --font-serif:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;
  --font-display:'Syne',Georgia,serif;
  --transition:0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--font-body);background:var(--bg-paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
@media(min-width:768px){.container{padding:0 40px}}
@media(min-width:1024px){.container{padding:0 60px}}

/* NAV */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;height:72px;background:rgba(15,18,56,0.97);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}
.nav-inner{max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px}
.nav-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0}
.nav-links{display:none;align-items:center;gap:8px}
@media(min-width:1024px){.nav-links{display:flex}}
.nav-link{padding:8px 16px;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:#94A3B8;border-radius:8px;transition:var(--transition)}
.nav-link:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05)}
.nav-link.active{color:#fff;position:relative}
.nav-link.active::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.nav-btn{padding:10px 20px;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:8px;transition:var(--transition);border:none}
.nav-btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#94A3B8;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12)}
.nav-btn-ghost:hover{color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25)}
.nav-btn-primary{background:#fff;color:#0F1238}
.nav-btn-primary:hover{background:#EEF0FF}
.lang-dropdown{position:relative}
.lang-dropdown-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:8px;color:#E2E8F0;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:var(--transition)}
.lang-dropdown-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1)}
.lang-dropdown-menu{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 8px);right:0;min-width:140px;padding:8px 0;background:#0F1238;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-8px);transition:var(--transition);z-index:100}
.lang-dropdown:hover .lang-dropdown-menu,.lang-dropdown:focus-within .lang-dropdown-menu{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0)}
.lang-option{display:block;padding:10px 16px;font-size:.875rem;color:#94A3B8;transition:var(--transition)}
.lang-option:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:#fff}
.lang-option.active{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

/* Shared */
.section-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.section-eyebrow.with-rule::before{content:'';width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.5}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--ink)}
.section-title .em{font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent-strong)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 28px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.84rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:4px;border:none;transition:var(--transition);cursor:pointer}
.btn-accent{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.btn-accent:hover{background:var(--accent-strong)}
.btn-ink{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--rule-2)}
.btn-ink:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#F5F0E7;border:1px solid rgba(245,240,231,0.25)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:rgba(245,240,231,0.55)}

/* MASTHEAD */
.masthead{padding:80px 0 60px;background:var(--bg-paper);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.masthead-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-2);margin-bottom:36px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}
.masthead-top .right{color:var(--accent)}
.masthead h1{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:500;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.5rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:24px}
.masthead h1 .em{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-strong)}
.masthead-lede{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:720px}
.masthead-byline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:32px;margin-top:36px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
.masthead-byline span{color:var(--ink-3)}
.masthead-byline strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;margin-left:6px}

/* ORIGIN — editorial 2col */
.origin{padding:100px 0;background:var(--bg-paper)}
.origin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}
@media(min-width:900px){.origin-grid{grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;gap:96px}}
.origin-meta{position:sticky;top:100px;align-self:start}
.origin-meta .section-title{margin-bottom:20px}
.origin-meta-note{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:24px}
.origin-body p{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.1875rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:24px}
.origin-body p.lead{font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;padding-bottom:32px;margin-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.origin-body em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent-strong);font-weight:600}
.dropcap::first-letter{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:5rem;float:left;line-height:.85;padding:6px 14px 0 0;color:var(--accent-strong)}

/* MISSION — pull statement */
.mission{padding:100px 0;background:var(--bg-paper-2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-2)}
.mission-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}
@media(min-width:900px){.mission-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:80px}}
.mission-stamp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;border:1px solid var(--rule-2);padding:24px;background:#fff;position:relative}
.mission-stamp::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-1px;left:-1px;right:-1px;height:3px;background:var(--accent)}
.mission-stamp .label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.mission-stamp .name{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.15;color:var(--ink)}
.mission-stamp dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:8px 16px;font-size:.84rem;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed var(--rule-2)}
.mission-stamp dt{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);padding-top:3px}
.mission-stamp dd{color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45}
.mission-statement{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:var(--ink)}
.mission-statement .em{font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent-strong)}
.mission-statement .hl{background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 60%,rgba(190,58,75,.18) 60%,rgba(190,58,75,.18) 92%,transparent 92%);padding:0 .08em;font-weight:500}
.mission-cite{display:block;margin-top:32px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}

/* PRINCIPLES — editorial numbered list */
.princ{padding:110px 0;background:var(--bg-paper)}
.princ-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:56px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);flex-wrap:wrap}
.princ-head-meta{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);padding-bottom:6px}
.princ-list{list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
.princ-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;padding:32px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
@media(min-width:800px){.princ-list li{grid-template-columns:88px 1.2fr 2fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}}
.princ-num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--accent);padding-top:4px}
.princ-list li:nth-child(1) .princ-num::before{content:'01 /'}
.princ-list li:nth-child(2) .princ-num::before{content:'02 /'}
.princ-list li:nth-child(3) .princ-num::before{content:'03 /'}
.princ-list li:nth-child(4) .princ-num::before{content:'04 /'}
.princ-list li:nth-child(5) .princ-num::before{content:'05 /'}
.princ-title{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:500;font-style:italic;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ink)}
.princ-title .em{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-strong)}
.princ-body{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2)}

/* TIMELINE — dark band */
.timeline{background:var(--ink);color:#F5F0E7;padding:110px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.timeline::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,rgba(190,58,75,.16),transparent 50%);pointer-events:none}
.timeline-inner{position:relative;max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.timeline-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:56px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,240,231,0.12);flex-wrap:wrap}
.timeline-head .section-title{color:#fff;max-width:620px}
.timeline-head-meta{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A19888;padding-bottom:6px}
.t-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,240,231,0.12)}
@media(min-width:800px){.t-row{grid-template-columns:140px 220px 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}}
.t-year{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.04em}
.t-mark{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D6CDBE;padding-top:8px}
.t-body{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.55;color:#D6CDBE}
.t-body strong{color:#fff;font-weight:500}

/* TEAM — directors page */
.team{padding:110px 0;background:var(--bg-paper)}
.team-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:48px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);flex-wrap:wrap}
.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}
@media(min-width:700px){.team-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1024px){.team-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.member{padding:28px 0 24px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
.member-mono{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px}
.member-name{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.15;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.member-role{font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-3);margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--rule-2)}
.member-bio{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-2)}

/* ETHICS — split */
.ethics{padding:110px 0;background:var(--bg-paper-2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-2)}
.ethics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}
@media(min-width:900px){.ethics-grid{grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}}
.ethics-left .section-title{margin-bottom:24px}
.ethics-left p{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.125rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:20px}
.ethics-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:36px 32px 32px;position:relative}
.ethics-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-1px;left:-1px;right:-1px;height:3px;background:var(--accent)}
.ethics-card h3{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:600;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:20px;padding-bottom:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.ethics-card ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.ethics-card ul li{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink);padding-left:22px;position:relative;line-height:1.55}
.ethics-card ul li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:.6em;width:12px;height:1px;background:var(--accent)}
.ethics-card ul li strong{color:var(--accent-strong);font-weight:600}
.ethics-card .foot{margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px dashed var(--rule-2);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.ethics-card .foot a{color:var(--accent)}

/* TRUST strip */
.trust{padding:64px 0;background:var(--bg-paper);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
.trust-inner{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px}
.trust-label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}
.trust-marks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:36px;align-items:center}
.trust-mark{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.84rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink);padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:transparent}
.trust-mark.alt{background:var(--ink);color:#F5F0E7;border-color:var(--ink)}

/* PULL QUOTE */
.pullquote-section{padding:100px 0;background:var(--bg-paper)}
.pullquote{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.pullquote::before{content:'';display:block;width:64px;height:2px;background:var(--accent);margin:0 auto 32px}
.pullquote-text{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.5vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:var(--ink)}
.pullquote-text strong{font-weight:600;font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 62%,rgba(190,58,75,.18) 62%,rgba(190,58,75,.18) 92%,transparent 92%);padding:0 .08em}
.pullquote-cite{display:block;margin-top:28px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}

/* CTA */
.cta{padding:110px 0;background:var(--ink);color:#F5F0E7;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cta::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,rgba(190,58,75,.20),transparent 60%);pointer-events:none}
.cta-inner{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;position:relative}
.cta-eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:24px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.cta h2{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.25rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px}
.cta h2 .em{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
.cta p{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.1875rem;line-height:1.65;color:#D6CDBE;margin-bottom:40px}
.cta-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:14px}

/* FOOTER */
.footer{padding:80px 0 40px;background:var(--bg-dark);color:#94A3B8}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px;margin-bottom:64px}
@media(min-width:768px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr}}
.footer-brand p{font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:320px;margin-top:20px}
.footer-col h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E2E8F0;margin-bottom:20px}
.footer-col a{display:block;font-size:.9375rem;margin-bottom:14px;transition:var(--transition)}
.footer-col a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.footer-bottom{padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:.84rem;color:#64748B}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:24px}
.footer-links a:hover{color:#E2E8F0}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo" aria-label="ASPS home">
      <svg width="120" height="32" viewBox="0 0 148 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="40" rx="1.5" fill="url(#logoGrad)"/>
        <text x="12" y="27" font-family="'Syne', serif" font-weight="800" font-size="22" fill="#FFFFFF" letter-spacing="-0.5">ASPS</text>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#1F8B5C"/>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#1F8B5C" opacity="0.4"><animate attributeName="r" values="4;8;4" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/><animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.4;0;0.4" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/></circle>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
        <defs><linearGradient id="logoGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="40" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1F8B5C"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#16734C"/></linearGradient></defs>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="index.html#epidemic" class="nav-link">Угроза</a>
      <a href="platform.html" class="nav-link">Как это работает</a>
      <a href="knowledge.html" class="nav-link">Центр знаний</a>
      <a href="stories.html" class="nav-link">Истории</a>
      <a href="partners.html" class="nav-link">Партнёры</a>
      <a href="about.html" class="nav-link active">О нас</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <div class="lang-dropdown">
        <button class="lang-dropdown-btn" aria-label="Select language"><span>RU</span><svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 5l4 4 4-4"/></svg></button>
        <div class="lang-dropdown-menu">
          <a href="../about.html" class="lang-option">English</a>
          <a href="../he/about.html" class="lang-option">עברית</a>
          <a href="../fr/about.html" class="lang-option">Français</a>
          <span class="lang-option active">Русский</span>
          <a href="../es/about.html" class="lang-option">Español</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="contact.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-ghost">Контакты</a>
      <a href="protection-plans.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-primary">Защититься</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- MASTHEAD -->
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="masthead-top">
      <span>О нас · Наша миссия</span>
      <span class="right">Защищаем людей, а не системы</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Защищаем людей от <span class="em">манипуляции.</span></h1>
        <p class="masthead-lede">We're building technology that helps people recognize and resist scams — not after the damage, but in the moment it matters most. Real-time protection at the moment of decision, when manipulation is happening.</p>
    <div class="masthead-byline">
      <span>Потери в год<strong>$400B+</strong></span>
      <span>Людей под угрозой<strong>5B+ worldwide</strong></span>
      <span>Real-time solutions before ASPS<strong>Zero</strong></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- WHY -->
<section class="origin" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="origin-grid">
      <div class="origin-meta">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Почему существует ASPS</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Защита в реальном времени <span class="em">для каждого.</span></h2>
        <p class="origin-meta-note">A simple observation that started everything</p>
      </div>
      <div class="origin-body">
        <p class="lead dropcap">Scams are a global epidemic affecting billions of people. Yet until now, there has been no real solution that protects people during the scam itself.</p>
        <p>Traditional anti‑fraud tools focus on protecting systems — detecting fraudulent transactions, blocking suspicious emails, filtering spam. But modern scams don't attack systems. <em>They attack people.</em></p>
        <p>Scammers use psychology, urgency, fear, and increasingly AI to manipulate victims into taking actions they wouldn't otherwise take. By the time a transaction is flagged, the damage is often done.</p>
        <p>ASPS is different. We protect people <em>at the moment of decision</em> — when they're on a call with a scammer, when they're about to click a malicious link, when they're being manipulated in real‑time. We give people the information they need to make the right choice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION -->
<section class="mission" id="mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mission-inner">
      <div class="mission-stamp">
        <span class="label">Наша миссия</span>
        <p class="name">Защита в реальном времени для каждого.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Потери в год</dt><dd>$400B+ globally</dd>
          <dt>Людей под угрозой</dt><dd>5B+ worldwide</dd>
          <dt>Real‑time solutions before ASPS</dt><dd>Zero</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mission-statement">We exist to protect people <span class="hl">at the moment of decision</span> — not after the damage, not before the threat, but <span class="em">in the exact second a person is being manipulated.</span> Until protection lives at that moment, the rest doesn't matter.</p>
        <span class="mission-cite">— Our founding mission, in one line</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRINCIPLES — original 5 ethics principles -->
<section class="princ" id="ethics">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="princ-head">
      <div>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Наши этические обязательства</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Пять принципов, <span class="em">в письменном виде.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <span class="princ-head-meta">Создание защиты предполагает ответственность</span>
    </div>

    <ol class="princ-list">
      <li>
        <span class="princ-num"></span>
        <h3 class="princ-title">Transparency in <span class="em">detection.</span></h3>
        <p class="princ-body">When we flag something as a potential scam, we explain why. Users should understand our reasoning and be empowered to make their own decisions — never asked to trust a black box.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="princ-num"></span>
        <h3 class="princ-title">No exploitation of <span class="em">fear.</span></h3>
        <p class="princ-body">We will never use fear‑based marketing or exaggerate threats to drive adoption. Protection should empower, not frighten. The story is hard enough without us adding to it.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="princ-num"></span>
        <h3 class="princ-title">Data <span class="em">minimization.</span></h3>
        <p class="princ-body">We collect the minimum data necessary to provide protection. What we don't collect, we can't lose or misuse. Privacy is a design constraint, not a feature.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="princ-num"></span>
        <h3 class="princ-title">No surveillance <span class="em">capitalism.</span></h3>
        <p class="princ-body">We will never sell user data or use it for advertising. Our business model is protection, not surveillance. We're paid by the people we protect — never by anyone else looking at them.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="princ-num"></span>
        <h3 class="princ-title">Bias <span class="em">vigilance.</span></h3>
        <p class="princ-body">We actively work to identify and eliminate bias in our detection systems. Protection must work equally well for everyone — every accent, every age, every region. Anything less is a failure of the mission.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESPONSIBLE AI -->
<section class="ethics">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ethics-grid">
      <div class="ethics-left">
        <span class="section-eyebrow with-rule">Ответственный ИИ</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Мощный инструмент, <span class="em">используемый осторожно.</span></h2>
        <p>We recognize that AI is a powerful tool that can be used for both protection and manipulation. We commit to using AI only for protection, with full transparency about how our systems work.</p>
        <p>We believe that the same technologies being used by scammers — voice cloning, deepfakes, AI‑generated content — can and should be used to protect people. But this requires constant vigilance and ethical reflection.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ethics-card">
        <h3>Наши шесть ценностей.</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Protection over profit</strong> — we measure success by harm prevented, not just revenue.</li>
          <li><strong>Privacy by design</strong> — a fundamental right, not a feature we ship later.</li>
          <li><strong>Ответственный ИИ</strong> — transparent, explainable, always under human oversight.</li>
          <li><strong>Public conversation</strong> — surfacing fraud in households, workplaces, media and policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Lived experience</strong> — we learn from people who've been targeted, and it shapes everything.</li>
          <li><strong>Collaborative defense</strong> — no single organization stops scams alone.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="foot">
          <span>Последняя проверка · Апр 2026</span>
          <a href="privacy.html">Читать полную политику →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW WE GOT HERE -->
<section class="timeline" id="story">
  <div class="timeline-inner">
    <div class="timeline-head">
      <div>
        <span class="section-eyebrow" style="color:#F0A8B4">Наша история</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Как мы <span class="em">пришли к этому.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <span class="timeline-head-meta">От наблюдения к движению</span>
    </div>

    <div class="t-row">
      <div class="t-num" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:2.2rem;color:#F0A8B4;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1">01 /</div>
      <h3 class="t-stage" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em">The <span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:#F0A8B4">problem.</span></h3>
      <p class="t-body" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.65;color:#D8CFC2">We saw friends and family fall victim to scams — smart, careful people manipulated by increasingly sophisticated attacks. Traditional solutions weren't working. The whole defence stack was pointed at networks and accounts, while the attack walked straight past it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="t-row">
      <div class="t-num" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:2.2rem;color:#F0A8B4;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1">02 /</div>
      <h3 class="t-stage" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em">The <span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:#F0A8B4">insight.</span></h3>
      <p class="t-body" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.65;color:#D8CFC2">We realized that scams succeed not because people are foolish, but because attackers exploit universal human psychology. Protection needs to work in real‑time, at the moment of manipulation — not at the bank, not at the carrier, but on the person, in the moment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="t-row">
      <div class="t-num" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:2.2rem;color:#F0A8B4;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1">03 /</div>
      <h3 class="t-stage" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em">The <span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:#F0A8B4">solution.</span></h3>
      <p class="t-body" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.65;color:#D8CFC2">We built ASPS to be the protection layer that didn't exist — analyzing communications in real‑time, detecting manipulation tactics, and warning users before they make irreversible decisions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="t-row">
      <div class="t-num" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:2.2rem;color:#F0A8B4;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1">04 /</div>
      <h3 class="t-stage" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em">The <span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:#F0A8B4">movement.</span></h3>
      <p class="t-body" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.65;color:#D8CFC2">Beyond technology, we're building a movement. Breaking the stigma around scams, sharing stories openly, and creating a world where being targeted is no longer shameful.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PULL QUOTE -->
<section class="pullquote-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pullquote">
      <p class="pullquote-text">Technology should protect human agency, not undermine it. Every system we build is designed to <strong>help people make better decisions</strong> — never to make decisions for them.</p>
      <span class="pullquote-cite">— Our commitment to responsible AI</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

